1767 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project provides a data-driven approach to automated product categorization by combining exploratory analysis, NLP-based feature engineering, machine learning classification, model evaluation, and explainability. The findings highlight how product naming patterns, technical specifications, character-level features, and category-specific terminology contribute to accurate classification across ten product categories. Model evaluation demonstrates the effectiveness of character-level TF-IDF and Ridge Classifier, achieving a Macro F1-score of 0.9886 on the test set, while identifying classification challenges involving closely related product categories and ambiguous product titles. The project establishes a foundation for improving product taxonomy management through enhanced text representations, ambiguity detection, classification confidence assessment, and further model optimization.)
/Dest [71 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 76 0 R
/Next 2740 0 R
>>
endobj
